		{"id":"113e2a519fe3b953","type":"text","text":"- 掌握 HTML5， CSS3， JS，可快速搭建前端界面，并对浏览器渲染， Event Loop 有一定了解","x":30,"y":40,"width":700,"height":90},
		{"id":"96fe3d00698718cf","type":"text","text":"- 熟悉 Angular，Vue， React技术栈，并有实际项目开发经验","x":30,"y":150,"width":700,"height":65},
